scheduler    io.github.pderop.looma.impl.JdkActorScheduler, Builtin[parallelism=10]
poller mode  not set
sessions     100,000, 8 backend connection(s) per container
state        10,000 products; a cart keeps 20 lines, a profile 20 viewed products
fraud        a table of 1024 KiB per container, 256 features per check
load         150,000 req/s, 4 client thread(s) on CPUs [0, 1, 16, 17]
backend      127.0.0.1:8081
window       10s warm-up, then a ramp from 150,000 req/s, 20,000 more at each step; at each step 10s measured and 3s to go up to it

